00:35:18.987 --> 00:35:20.607
So it's always the intangible things.

00:35:20.607 --> 00:35:21.440
- But it's P and P, right?

00:35:21.440 --> 00:35:23.416
It's patience and practicality.

00:35:23.416 --> 00:35:24.771
You have both those things, Eugene.

00:35:24.771 --> 00:35:26.477
