00:35:28.146 --> 00:35:30.077
every day is my last.

00:35:30.077 --> 00:35:31.483
And that is something from being a kid,

00:35:31.483 --> 00:35:32.619
and that's a problematic thing in even

00:35:32.619 --> 00:35:34.040
