day's your birthday party.

00:35:36.147 --> 00:35:37.589
And when I walk into Catch,

00:35:37.589 --> 00:35:38.877
I think every day's my birthday party,

00:35:38.877 --> 00:35:40.257
I don't think anyone's coming.

00:35:40.257 --> 00:35:42.379
So I get every morning with
that stress on my back.

00:35:42.379 --> 00:35:44.190
And I try to find that sense of urgency

00:35:44.190 --> 00:35:45.436
