00:35:50.089 --> 00:35:52.218
- You can't have entitlement in

00:35:52.218 --> 00:35:53.340
- No shit.
- the business that you do.

00:35:53.340 --> 00:35:54.781
You absolutely have to realize that--

00:35:54.781 --> 00:35:56.459
